ature, smell of the ocean, saw some elephant seals"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-1587c3a497d47a4cff2426b611ca540d"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-0879ff82e3d01ab69eaf6851b1464dc7","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Professional:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-6c898c5210902bd12df6784b3281d5b3"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-09ef96b10ddee3ff5cbd5d167982532c"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-4a2491b0095d5b93061d77b1fb7774a9","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"we opened the I-9 docs back up, and I learned to really look carefully at how the names are documented on the IDs to ensure the I-9 docs reflect EXACTLY that."}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-6b9a025820b75c58042a55db1e5265dd"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-6376417362c5cf9e2a68c815b13867d3"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-2ffae0c314991bb572898d58a177c985","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Ex: if someone has 2 last names as their surname on their ID, they need to BOTH be filled in the surname box, and not the \"other last name\" box"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-3a566c469284c3176f2f85298f47ef3f"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-4d379000d5af85b320f43e52a3e094ab","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"I brought up to Christina a few important situations that I should have brought up earlier. I didn't understand the weight these situations carried in regards to compliance, but learning how to tackle the difficult situations/decisions."}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-6e7eab64c3d690a7f6a55b74972cfcc3"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-4f6a26190b7b46fdcb9f510d1532a244","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"FLASH What’s shifted in the environment that your teammate(s) need to react to?"}]}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-7b0f24a74a5ad660fa559b5a2b2f6c4d"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-dfc4386d51fe96f169dbf50f7aa29d6c"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-a580fb9aa68af9d8f824b94be7e36765","indentLevel":0}}]}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-cb5bedda0155c6c11d4f2abd0abbf3b6"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-c041c01d7640e9e6bee1b29357ceb35e"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-46786e30fc5eaa4e3e631f553021fa69","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"we have the greenlight to turn the shower upstairs into a lactation room! would just need to send the plans over to Prologis for approval first, before starting knocking anything down"}]}]}]},{"type":"mangoAttachmentImage","attrs":{"attachmentId":"019f7fe7-e6e1-7001-99f6-8f3395f5c255","filename":"image.png","mimeType":"image/png","width":720,"height":89,"displayWidth":720,"displayHeight":89,"alignment":"left","position":"break","layout":"content","alt":"","title":""}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-9de99baddda9413e567dcd0e3a3856da","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-ad58d1c1490ea06d1f98266febeec48e"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"