List","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-940e5f93da6fd86026971117c8e0248c"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-140cece0a73428314c8307ff7e3f72e7"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-cb941915625a5095cb637b4abba058a5","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"ALERT/UNLOCK  Where are you spinning your wheels or falling behind, and could use some help, ideas, or collaboration to keep moving?"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-05012c5276bbc1d57d4fee5f5760ac56","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}},{"type":"bold"}],"text":"HR Manager, Christina"}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-d65646e6d222b31bcd115930e16fd919"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-c817e6ea7f3211ba0c7d1628eeb92da9"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-3940431531b83e94e14513442b5a8727","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"BRIDGE- Highlights/Lowlights, Any Learnings?"}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-b857c01ec709eb4c80e7989417fc3a41"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-2a0f2c109a019431e729c030900d6073"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-c3f1b15fc6a462156582b640bc4ab561","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Personal: Had a really restful weekend. Picked up spam musubi from Costco last weekend and it was a huge hit with the boys, it's such an easy, satisfying snack to have on hand. Also got to celebrate my brother's housewarming and my oldest son's birthday, all in one weekend with family. Grateful for weekends like this. It's a good reminder that staying close with family and friends takes real effort as we get older, and that time together is worth prioritizing."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-da6a37556e40189bfad7a60c4aa88e67"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-3829d71b6887051e1d4aae46f8bee853","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Professional: Last week was a busy one. While I felt like I wasn't knocking out as many of the smaller, day-to-day tasks as I'd have liked, we made real strides on the long-term, systems-level work. The kind that sets up a stronger foundation going forward. Good reminder that progress isn't always visible day-to-day, but building the right systems now will pay off down the line."}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-471ddaeabcd05df48ade41ec69a5a201"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-832f72443da01cfde8710e0b789df5db","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"FLASH What’s shifted in the environment that your teammate(s) need to react to?"}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-ce732406dcdfcfc1de1298e71c81f11f"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-e3a1d81e8b354dc8a3eaa91409138535"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-4f432a8fd271603f532a5cd75da655c3","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Melvin is out of the country and not available until 8/5. Our option is to schedule a virtual interview for next week or wait for the on-site in Fullerton and Anaheim. Thoughts? "},{"type":"mention","attrs":{"userId":"019e090c-e62f-781b-bd70-5ab7597ffe1c","label":"Tim Kim","kind":"normal"},"marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px","color":"#0f172a"}},{"type":"bold"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-e307edeee076ee9e3cee3fdbe2cdb72d"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-f35133b520cdce1956625de9d549580d","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"BEACON What are your main Missions today? "}]},{"type":"bulletList","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-df8cc3c866475b83fb4bb8c4365dc651"},"content":[{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-1dee276903218ba1e64af4fba4d5b569"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-7b0de078fe422916e054584517715225","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Process Final Pay for Truc with Eugene 8:30AM"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-2a9cc835926d158559a603c0ecabc691"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-2ee5fd28eb9d0e52714e84220a76fbf4","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"Essential HR Partners Demo 10:30"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-2edb1d7e5c172d61e72baa5c9703c62a"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-7e49e3d40297a96f472af56f8553122c","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"ORR 1PM"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-3a79703b6a2280c225e90d015873d4c1"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"blockId":"mango-import-1621591659eb72684bc8cb62f31b5494","indentLevel":0},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"fontSize":"14px"}}],"text":"HR Huddle 1:15PM"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","attrs":{"blockId":"mango-import-789af82b40095e1e188b734dbb6ca8d5"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","att